  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7002.171 “Legal representative” means a lawyer admitted to the bar of New Hampshire, another state, territory, or the District of Columbia and includes the lawyer’s law firm.\n\nSource. #13957, INTERIM, eff 5-7-24, EXPIRES: 11-3-24; ss by #14090, eff 10-1-24",
